// The offset of a tag counts characters of the text shown, the same on every
// target: an accented letter, a Chinese character or an emoji is one character,
// whatever its size in UTF-8 or UTF-16. An emoji sequence counts each of its
// characters (the joiners too). Escapes count as the character they give.

state
  name: Zoé
  coins: 3
  dragon: 🐉

character bob
  name: Bob

beat Start
  Café <b>chaud</b>, 你好<i>朋友</i>.

  Dragon 🐉<em>feu</em> et 👩‍👩‍👧<big>famille</big>.

  Prix $$5 et \#1 <b>seulement</b>.

  $name <happy>sourit</happy>, $dragon<s>vole</s>, ${coins} 🪙<u>pièces</u>.

  bob: 😀 Ça <wave>va</wave> très <b>bien</b>!

